  dialogueLines:
  - 'It seems your body has gained full control of itself. '
  - That is good.
  - Do not be afraid. I am here to help.
  - Your body has been preserved for future study.
  - But for some reason you have been awaken.
  - I wonder where everybody is?
  - I suggest we should take a look around.
  - Let us see if the door is open.
